<!--Post: 6843--><!--Time: 1108043345-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6843"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Topsailgrl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Topsailgrl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 5:49 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Part way through this video, there is a man speaking to the camera in a black jacket, who is he? And how can we find out? Obviously with WPD in some fashion. <a href="http://kshb.dayport.com/viewer/viewerpage.php?Art_ID=95435" target=_top>http://kshb.dayport.com/viewer/viewerpage.php?Art_ ID=95435</a> <BR> <BR>Back on Feb. 2nd I posted here <a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/3/26.html?1107964722" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/3/26.html? 1107964722</a> <BR> <BR>About the way BTK pronounced the word homicide. The man in this video pronounced it the very same way!!!!!!! VERY UNUSUAL WAY TO PRONOUNCE IT! The man in the video needs to be found immediately! If this man in the video were not speaking in such a calm manner, if his speach was rushed as the speach in the phone call was, I honestly believe his voice would match! I really think this man must be found. <BR> <BR>PLEASE CHECK IT OUT! COMPARE IT WITH THE RECORDING OF THE PHONE CALL PLACED AFTER THE FOX MURDER AND SEE IF YOU DO NOT CATCH THE SAME PRONOUNIATION. <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6843-->
<!--Post: 6869--><!--Time: 1108057680-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6869"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 9:48 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hi Topsakgrl <BR> <BR>I agree this man with black/brown hair and a black/darkblue? coat pronounce Homicide the same way as BTK doeas in the Nancy Fox murder phone call. <BR>To me he looks hispanic and heavy built. He is in 3 more sequences of the video and is carrying a big notebook/papers in his left hand.  <BR>To me he appears to be a detective at som quite high range.  <BR>Send it to WPD, I think you could be on to somthing importent. <BR>GREAT! find.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6869-->
<!--Post: 6880--><!--Time: 1108061807-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6880"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 10:56 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->TOpsagirl I think you should lay out that #1 on BTK forums on <a href="http://www.amw.com" target=_top>www.amw.com</a> and on <a href="http://www.kansas.com" target=_top>www.kansas.com</a> and C&amp;J forum too. The more people that see this man the better chance to find out who he is. <BR>If it is too much trouble for you to do it I would be glad to do it for you. please let me know? <BR> <BR>Steve relford Shirley Vians son who has been intervied on KAKE-TV have apparently said that the first police that came to the scene looked like BTK. Actually He should see that video and see if he recognized the guy! <BR>I sugest that you email KAKE-TV and sugest they show Steve the video, KAKE is the one who are able to get in kontakt with Steve. <BR>skov<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6880-->
<!--Post: 6886--><!--Time: 1108062896-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6886"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 11:14 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hi Topsakgrl <BR> <BR>I have started a thred on AMW and KASNAS asking for if there exsist a list of police officers and detectives that have worked the BTK case. I also added the video and asked people to post if the know who he is. I will post links here to those two threds in a while. <BR>Hope that is OK <BR>skov<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6886-->
<!--Post: 6889--><!--Time: 1108063099-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6889"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skiller<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skiller<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 11:18 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Skov Ill be waiting for your info thanks<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6889-->
<!--Post: 6893--><!--Time: 1108063932-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6893"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 11:32 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Here are links to the two threds I have started. <BR>And again will you email the WPD with your finding? If not please tell me because otherwise I´ll be happy do it for you, I realy think they should know. <BR> <BR><a href="http://forums.prospero.com/foxamw/messages" target=_top>http://forums.prospero.com/foxamw/messages</a> <BR> <BR><a href="http://forums.prospero.com/n/mb/message.asp?webtag=kr-kansas_news&amp;msg=5839.1&amp;ctx=1" target=_top>http://forums.prospero.com/n/mb/message.asp?webtag =kr-kansas_news&amp;msg=5839.1&amp;ctx=1</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6893-->
<!--Post: 6896--><!--Time: 1108064539-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6896"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Newyorker<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Newyorker<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 11:42 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Wow, that is so crazy! WPD should definitley check him out, maybe that&#39;s why BTK is always ahead of the game, he&#39;s IN it !<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6896-->
<!--Post: 6897--><!--Time: 1108064566-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6897"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skiller<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skiller<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 11:42 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Skov where do i go to get a look at this guy?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6897-->
<!--Post: 6898--><!--Time: 1108065010-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6898"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Topsailgrl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Topsailgrl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 11:50 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hi Skov, <BR> <BR>I havent had time to do any of it and thanks for geting it out there. I dont even post over on those sites, I read from time to time but this is the only BTK site I post at.  <BR> <BR>I agree with Steve needing to see video of this man. 28 years ago is a long time for someone who was at the time 5 to 6 years old but I myself am 40 and have some very very vivid memories of persons from that age. And the kid pointed out someone working for the WPD!!  <BR> <BR>I think the WPD needs to take a look at it also.  <BR> <BR>The man does not particularly look Hispanic to me but I guess because of the dark hair, he could possibly have some Hispanic connections. I wouldnt want to speculate on that. I myself have never been 100% convinced that BTK is hispanic. <BR> <BR>I wish I had more time right now to mess with this but really have my hands full. If you guys can keep researching this, I have a creepy feeling, it could turn into something.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6898-->
<!--Post: 6909--><!--Time: 1108071140-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6909"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lorenap<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lorenap<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 1:32 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Isn&#39;t that, then police chief Richard LaMunyon? <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6909-->
<!--Post: 6910--><!--Time: 1108071275-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6910"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Topsailgrl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Topsailgrl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 1:34 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Lorenap-No, it is not him. Lamunyon has a very distinct nose, this man does not have that nose at all. There are clips of Lamunyon from that time frame and they look nothing alike.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6910-->
<!--Post: 6911--><!--Time: 1108071560-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6911"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 1:39 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hey - Kake just released &#40;or found&#41; that they have discovered the &#34;BTK LOST TAPES&#34; just tape into the &#34;links&#34; here on Tom&#39;s site go to Kake - the story is there.  I would like to see all of them. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6911-->
<!--Post: 6954--><!--Time: 1108090858-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6954"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Dee<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Dee<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 7:00 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Although I can find no picture of him anywhere, the man on the video MIGHT be Dr. William Eckert; deputy medical examiner that was on the scene of the Vian murder.  Dr. Eckert died in 1999, but that may solve the mystery man issue…  maybe.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
